# One author, one identity. Every commit in this repository was made by Greg Chism under two
# email configurations (the university address and GitHub's noreply); this maps both to the
# canonical personal address so `git log` / `shortlog` / `blame` report the sole author as one
# line. LIMIT, stated plainly: .mailmap governs git's own tooling only — GitHub attributes by
# email-to-account and ignores this file, so consolidating the GitHub contributor graph requires
# adding (and verifying) the secondary address on the account itself. The CLA bot's single
# machinery commit is deliberately NOT mapped: it is not authorship.
